Smoky Mountain Wrestling is a professional wrestling organization based in Knoxville, TN. Formed in the early 1990s, the promotion was started to recapture the lost glory of the territory days of professional wrestling. SMW focuses heavily on the old school southern style of wrestling and often features old territorial stars of the 1980s. The vision when forming the promotion was a territory that spanned the entire Southeastern part of the United States.
